{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,4],[1000013,99000003],[1000014,10000],[1000015,140],[1000016,-1],[1000017,-1],[1000018,-1],[1000019,-1],[1000020,140],[1000021,-1],[1000022,-1],[1000023,-1],[1000024,-1],[1000025,140],[1000026,-1],[1000027,-1],[1000028,-1],[1000029,-1],[1000030,140],[1000031,-1],[1000032,-1],[1000033,-1],[1000034,-1],[1000035,140],[1000036,-1],[1000037,-1],[1000038,-1],[1000039,-1],[1000040,140],[1000041,-1],[1000042,-1],[1000043,-1],[1000044,-1],[1000045,140],[1000046,-1],[1000047,-1],[1000048,-1],[1000049,-1],[1000050,140],[1000051,-1],[1000052,-1],[1000053,-1],[1000054,-1],[1000055,34],[1000056,35],[1000057,36],[1000058,77],[1000059,78],[1000060,33],[1000061,27],[1000062,28],[1000063,38],[1000064,39],[1000065,3],[1000066,25],[1000067,26],[1000068,30],[1000069,37],[1000070,10],[1000071,40],[1000072,41],[1000073,42],[1000074,43],[1000075,53],[1000076,80]],"messages":{"1000000":"Tower of the Wizard, 1F\n","1000001":"Tower of the Wizard, 2F\n","1000002":"Tower of the Wizard, 3F\n","1000003":"Tower of the Wizard, 4F\n","1000004":"Tower of the Wizard, 5F\n","1000005":"Tower of the Wizard, 6F\n","1000006":"Tower of the Wizard, 7F\n","1000007":"Tower of the Wizard, 8F\n","1000008":"Tower of the Wizard, 9F\n","1000009":"Tower of the Wizard, 10F\n","1000010":"Tower of the Wizard\n","1000011":"Are you a warrior?\nSorry, but I'm busy.\n","1000012":"Welcome, young man.\nI'm the Wizard Kirushutat.\n","1000013":"You must be in trouble because you cannot go through\nthe Village of Elves.  Did you know it's because of the Dragons?\n","1000014":"The dragons that have been sealed in the mine are just larvae,\nbut they are still among the strongest creatures in the world.\nThey are more powerful than the giant\nlizards that the knights got rid of.\n","1000015":"If the dragons left their enclosures,\nthese areas would be burned to the ground..\n","1000016":"That's why\nthe Seal Facilities are on alert.\nWe've kept everyone away...\n","1000017":"But a group of thieves running around here\ndiscovered that there are dragons here.\nThey've been stupidly trying to break the seal.\n","1000018":"If they succeed, they'd surely lose their lives.\nThey don't seem to understand that...\n","1000019":"Some of the elves who were guarding the facilities were sent\nto the battlefield. The group of thieves took advantage of\nthis by taking over.\n","1000020":"The seal itself is very strong\nand cannot be broken easily.\nI hope the thieves will give up soon,\nbut they've been trying hard.\n","1000021":"Regrettably, the thieves stole a Crystal\nkey for the Seal Facilities.\n","1000022":"Although it was securely locked away,\nit was still stolen.\n","1000023":"Because of this, fear among the elves has grown.\nThere are rumors that the humans might have stolen\nthe crystal to use the dragons for war.\nThe elves are nervous and paranoid.\n","1000024":"So, I need your help.\nThe group of thieves has taken the Crystal to their fort\nin the Forest of Knight's Misery, to the west of Cross Agora.\n","1000025":"The thieves are using the Crystal to try\nto break the seal.\n","1000026":"I need you to get the Crystal before they succeed.\nIf you can do it, you can prove to elves\nthat humans can be trusted.\n","1000027":"The only person we can count on is you.\nWill you accept this mission?\n","1000028":"Good luck...\n","1000029":"Thank you for bringing it back!\nI'll inform the Village of Elves.\nYou can enter the village now.\n","1000030":"It's too early to feel relieved...\nThere seems to be a thief smarter than the rest.\nPortions of the seal have already been broken...\n","1000031":"We have to hurry...\n","1000032":"The Dragons are about to awaken.\nWe have to stop them!\n","1000033":"Wow!\nYou beat the Dragons! Well, you know,\ntheir power was diminished because of the seal...\n","1000034":"Yoahim...\nCent...\nDirunos...\n","1000035":"Oh, my friends were killed by the dragons' flames and went to Heaven.\nThey can sleep peacefully at last...\n","1000036":"Thank you for avenging my friends.  I, the Wizard Kirushutat,\nappreciate your efforts from the bottom of my heart.\n","1000037":"As a token of my gratitude,\nplease accept this humble gift.\n","1000038":"God bless you.\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,3],[0,3,10000001,4],[0,3,10000002,5],[0,3,10000003,6],[0,3,10000004,7],[0,3,10000005,8],[0,3,10000006,9],[0,3,10000007,10],[0,3,10000008,11],[0,3,10000009,12],[0,3,10000010,13],[0,3,10000011,14],[0,3,10000012,15],[0,3,10000013,16],[0,3,10000014,17],[0,3,10000015,18],[0,3,10000016,19],[0,3,10000017,20],[0,3,10000018,21],[0,0,12000000,22],[0,1,12000000,33],[1,0,10020000,45],[1,0,10020001,51],[0,2,110020000,52],[1,0,10020002,55],[1,0,10020003,61],[0,2,110020002,62],[1,0,10020004,65],[1,0,10020005,71],[0,2,110020004,72],[1,0,10020006,75],[1,0,10020007,81],[0,2,110020006,82],[1,0,10020008,85],[1,0,10020009,91],[0,2,110020008,92],[1,0,10020010,95],[1,0,10020011,101],[0,2,110020010,102],[1,0,10020012,105],[1,0,10020013,111],[0,2,110020012,112],[1,0,10020014,115],[1,0,10020015,121],[0,2,110020014,122]],"blocks":[[[50,[[4,1000005]]],[0,[[4,1000005],[0,2],[1,-1],[0,1]]],[0,[[4,1000005],[0,3],[1,0],[0,2]]]],[[1,[[4,1000006],[2,1000000]]],[14,[[4,1000005],[1,2]]],[11,[[4,1000005],[4,1000006]]],[49,[[4,1000005]]]],[[49,[[2,1000010]]]],[[17,[[1,2100005],[1,1]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,2]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,1]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,4]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,3]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,6]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,5]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,8]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,7]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,10]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,9]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,12]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,11]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,14]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,13]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,16]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,15]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,18]]]],[[17,[[1,2110000],[1,17]]]],[[18,[[1,12000000]]],[21,[[1,12000000],[1